/P 596 0 R
/E (Data mining is a rapidly growing field that is concerned with developing techniques to assist users to make intelligent use of their data repositories. A number of successful applications have been reported in areas such as credit rating, fraud detection, database marketing, customer relationship management, and stock market investments. The field of data mining has evolved from the disciplines of statistics and artificial intelligence. In this course, knowledge of the challenges and techniques in the field of Data Mining will be investigated. )
